{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Currently Under Development!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synth Laser is a dynamic laser maze rhythm game. Get ready to dodge and weave around the deadly and stunning laser show, built upon the outrun and synthwave music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game provides a breathtaking laser show with the precision of rhythm games. Players must dodge the zapping lasers, timing each movement to the beat of a mesmerizing synthwave soundtrack, creating a uniquely immersive flow state. Developed by solo indie creator Sarah Noor, the game blends razor-sharp gameplay with a stunning outrun aesthetic, offering a fresh take on the rhythm-action genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a Music-based Laser show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Synthwave style graphics and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and weave through the deadly lasers of the laser show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the level and move side to side to dodge the lasers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966300?t=1759486147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966300?t=1759486147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966300/b262d84d6dd3b158582d6fd648938957a941055a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759486147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966300/b262d84d6dd3b158582d6fd648938957a941055a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759486147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Currently Under Development!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synth Laser is a dynamic laser maze rhythm game. Get ready to dodge and weave around the deadly and stunning laser show, built upon the outrun and synthwave music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game provides a breathtaking laser show with the precision of rhythm games. Players must dodge the zapping lasers, timing each movement to the beat of a mesmerizing synthwave soundtrack, creating a uniquely immersive flow state. Developed by solo indie creator Sarah Noor, the game blends razor-sharp gameplay with a stunning outrun aesthetic, offering a fresh take on the rhythm-action genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a Music-based Laser show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Synthwave style graphics and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and weave through the deadly lasers of the laser show</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the level and move side to side to dodge the lasers</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sarah Noor"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966300/e9d760471fda5878e6922449952f2f8e56f7a6d4/header.jpg?t=1759486147","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966300/912007083/9a34e219c8cc6f3bdb734d5a176702a516f8b57f/1758306039/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758309509","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966300/912007083/9a34e219c8cc6f3bdb734d5a176702a516f8b57f/1758306039/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758309509","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966300/912007083/9a34e219c8cc6f3bdb734d5a176702a516f8b57f/1758306039/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758309509","id":257202361,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257202361/movie480.mp4?t=1758309509